OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest after pensioner in
OL,4,Aher 70s dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder following the death of a
OL,8,Fpensioner.
OL,10,FHertfordshire Police were called to
OL,11,FArmour Rise in Hitchin at 15:15 BST on
OL,12,FTuesday following a report of concern
OL,13,Ffor welfare.
OL,15,FA woman in her 70s was pronounced dead
OL,16,Fat the scene.
OL,18,FThe 59-year-old man remains in custody
OL,19,Fand police believe he and the woman
OL,20,Fwere known to each other.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
